Bound webview worker update waits and acquire the expected controller

A root PWA controller is not the webview worker. Reuse only the exact
registration scope and active script URL, bound update checks to three seconds,
and still require the matching controller before loading webview resources.
Initial registration remains mandatory. A narrowly validated claim message
handles documents created under the root worker after activation.

Test: test/e2e/webviewServiceWorker.test.ts (real browser registrations).

